## 🌟 Overview

**OT Roster Hub** is a **mobile-first**, real-time workforce management platform designed exclusively for hospital operating theatre teams.

It helps hospitals, surgical centres, and clinical staff eliminate paper schedules, reduce miscommunication, and streamline shift coordination.

**Perfect for:**
- 🏥 Hospitals & Surgical Centres
- 👨‍⚕️ Surgeons
- 👩‍⚕️ Theatre Nurses
- 🩺 Anaesthetists & Anaesthetic Teams
- ⚕️ Clinical Coordinators & Support Staff

---

## 🎯 Problems It Solves

| Traditional Rostering ❌ | OT Roster Hub ✅ |
|-------------------------|-----------------|
| Paper schedules & whiteboards | Real-time digital updates |
| Spreadsheet chaos & version conflicts | Clean, colour-coded calendar |
| Lost WhatsApp/Email messages | Built-in team chat |
| Shift clashes & poor visibility | Instant conflict detection |
| Limited mobile access | Full PWA — works offline |

---

## 📱 Install Like a Native App

**No App Store required** — Install directly from your browser.

### 🍎 iPhone / iPad (Safari)

1. Open the app in **Safari**
2. Tap the **Share** button ⬆️
3. Scroll and select **Add to Home Screen**
4. Tap **Add**

> ⚠️ Only works in Safari on iOS/iPadOS

### 🤖 Android (Chrome)

1. Open the app in **Chrome**
2. Tap the **Install** banner that appears
   **OR**
3. Tap the menu ⋮ → **Install app**

---

## ✨ Core Features

### 📅 **My Calendar**
- Personal shift management
- Custom shift types (Morning, Evening, On-Call, Training, Leave, etc.)
- Colour-coded & easy to read
- Quick add/edit with one tap

### 👥 **Team Roster**
- Department-wide visibility
- View everyone's shifts at a glance
- Theatre Nurses, Surgeons, Anaesthetists, Coordinators & more

### 💬 **Team Chat**
- Real-time messaging
- Department-specific channels
- Instant shift swap requests & responses

### 🪪 **Members Directory**
- Quick staff lookup
- Contact details & roles within your department

### 👤 **My Profile**
- Update details, preferences, theme
- View personal statistics
- Secure account management

### 🗄 **My Data**
Full transparency — see exactly what data is stored about you.

---

## 🔒 Privacy & Security

**Patient care demands trust.**  
OT Roster Hub uses **strict data isolation**:

- Users only see data from **their hospital** and **their department**
- No cross-hospital visibility
- All data encrypted in transit and at rest
- Powered by **Firebase Firestore**

### Account Deletion
One-click permanent deletion removes:
- All shifts
- Chat history
- Profile information

