## 🛠 Technology Stack

| Component       | Technology              |
|-----------------|-------------------------|
| **Backend**     | Firebase Firestore      |
| **Frontend**    | HTML + Tailwind CSS     |
| **Icons**       | Font Awesome            |
| **Holidays**    | Nager.Date API          |
| **Hosting**     | GitHub Pages            |
| **App Type**    | Progressive Web App (PWA) |

---

## 🚀 Getting Started

1. **Open the application**
2. **Complete your profile** (Name, Position, Hospital, Department, Country)
3. **Click "Enter the OR"** 🎭
4. Start managing shifts and connecting with your team!

> 💡 **Important**: Hospital name and Department must match **exactly** for colleagues to appear in the same workspace.

